    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Team 16, Student ID, please. Replays session.started through the dev endpoint (the same code path a broker consumer will use), lists channels per player, sends messages over REST, reads history, ends the session and checks that channels are archived. The WebSocket itself is tested with a Postman WebSocket request: ws://localhost:8086/api/v1/ws?session_id={{session_id}}&access_token={{moderator_token}}, then send {\"type\":\"message.send\",\"channel_id\":\"...\",\"content\":\"hi\"}. Requires DEV_ENDPOINTS=true."
  },
